docs {
  # Create Poll

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/groups/:groupID/polls`
  **Auth:** Required

  ## Description

  Creates an ACTIVE poll and all options in one transaction. The creator is the authenticated user's active membership in this group; creator and group IDs cannot be supplied through the body. At least two options are required. Visibility must be explicitly PUBLIC or PRIVATE and cannot be changed later. Questions and option titles are trimmed; duplicate option titles are rejected after trimming and case folding.

  Set `pollGroupId` manually to an actual group ID in the Local environment. Log in through Auth to populate `token`. After a successful response, copy `data.id` into `pollId` and the desired `options[].id` into `pollOptionId` in the Local environment, then save it before sending other poll requests. This request does not automatically populate or change any identifier. To create a private poll, change the saved body visibility to PRIVATE.

  The authenticated account and group membership must both be ACTIVE. Public visibility applies inside this group; it does not grant outsiders access.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive BIGINT group ID; Bruno variable `pollGroupId` |

  Path IDs must be from 1 to 9223372036854775807.

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `question` | `string` | `Yes` | `Question, 1 to 500 Unicode characters after trimming` |
  | `visibility` | `string` | `Yes` | `Exactly PUBLIC or PRIVATE` |
  | `options` | `array of strings` | `Yes` | `At least two distinct, non-empty titles, each at most 255 Unicode characters after trimming` |

  ```json
  {
    "question": "Which day works best?",
    "visibility": "PUBLIC",
    "options": [
      "Friday",
      "Saturday"
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  **`201 Created`**

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 701,
      "group_id": 10,
      "created_by_member_id": 30,
      "question": "Which day works best?",
      "visibility": "PUBLIC",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "is_frozen": false,
      "closed_at": null,
      "created_at": "2026-11-05T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-05T10:00:00Z",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": 801,
          "title": "Friday",
          "vote_count": 0
        },
        {
          "id": 802,
          "title": "Saturday",
          "vote_count": 0
        }
      ],
      "total_votes": 0,
      "my_option_id": null
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  Errors use the same envelope as the existing Auth and Friendships endpoints. Internal causes are not exposed.

  | HTTP | code | error | When |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | 400 | `BAD_REQUEST` | `bad request payload or parameters` | Invalid path ID, JSON payload, required field, value type, filter or pagination. |
  | 401 | `MISSING_TOKEN` | `authorization token is missing` | Authorization is missing or does not contain a Bearer token. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_INVALID` | `authorization token is invalid` | The token is invalid, malformed, not an access token, or has an invalid user ID. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_EXPIRED` | `authorization token has expired` | The access token expired. |
  | 401 | `TOKEN_REVOKED` | `authorization token has been revoked` | The access token is blacklisted, for example after Logout. |
  | 403 | `USER_INACTIVE` | `user account is deactivated` | The authenticated account is not ACTIVE. |
  | 403 | `POLL_FORBIDDEN` | `only active group members can access this poll` | The user has no active membership in this group or has left it. |
  | 404 | `USER_NOT_FOUND` | `user not found` | The authenticated account does not exist or has been soft-deleted. |
  | 404 | `GROUP_NOT_FOUND` | `group not found` | The group does not exist or has been soft-deleted. |
  | 409 | `POLL_GROUP_INACTIVE` | `polls cannot be changed while the group is inactive` | The group is inactive; creation is frozen. |
  | 400 | `POLL_INVALID_OPTIONS` | `provide at least two non-empty options with titles of at most 255 characters` | An option is blank after trimming or contains unsupported text. |
  | 400 | `POLL_DUPLICATE_OPTIONS` | `poll options must be unique` | Option titles repeat after trimming and case folding. |
  | 500 | `INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` | `an internal server error occurred` | A database, transaction or Redis operation fails; internal details stay hidden. |

  **Example: 400**

  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "code": "POLL_INVALID_OPTIONS",
    "error": "provide at least two non-empty options with titles of at most 255 characters"
  }
  ```
}
